  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The cause of the self-identified event was inadequate standards in Procedure Use and Adherence. The SRO performing the LLRT procedure incorrectly assumed that the -84B would be restored through some other process but did not validate this assumption or obtain a peer check, as was required by procedure. Instead, the procedure step was annotated that the valve would be left closed per the Unit Supervisor.",
